<title>SPAIN: UBS and CSFB buy stake in Spanish Asturian.</title>
<headline>UBS and CSFB buy stake in Spanish Asturian.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish Corporacion Banesto said on Friday it had sold its eight-percent stake in Asturiana de Zinc for 8.23 billion pesetas.</p>
<p>&quot;We sold the eight percent yesterday and Wednesday  to banks UBS and CSFB,&quot; said a spokesman.</p>
<p>He added that a first tranche for 3.2 percent had been sold at 2,500 pesetas per share, while another 4.8 percent was sold at 2,600 pesetas/share.  </p>
<p>In the future, the two foreign banks are expected to sell the stake they bought to institutional investors, the spokesman said.</p>
<p>In February this year Corporacion Banesto sold another 25 percent of Asturiana del Zinc to Swiss group Glencore.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
